WEBVTT

00:14:59.895 --> 00:15:02.439
But all that means
we're going to have to do something

00:15:02.481 --> 00:15:05.484
which, for the political establishment
and status-quo thinking,

00:15:05.525 --> 00:15:06.985
has been anathema for decades.

00:15:06.985 --> 00:15:08.779
And that means returning the state --

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:10.280
yes, the state --

00:15:10.322 --> 00:15:13.867
to the center stage
of our economic and social lives.

00:15:13.867 --> 00:15:15.035
Thank you.

00:15:15.077 --> 00:15:21.708
(Applause)

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:23.919
Chris Anderson: Thank you, Aaron.

00:15:23.961 --> 00:15:26.838
I think we have
a secret questioner somewhere,

00:15:26.838 --> 00:15:32.886
in the form of Maja Bosnic,
who is a public finance expert.